    <name>Hayden Rd, Benton County / part1 / simulator showcase</name>
    <desc>Follows the Arkansas GIS Office centerline of Hayden Rd (south to north), 1300 m: two tight bends, about 90 degrees each. The real bundled curves on this road lie within 1 m of this line. Replay never uploads.</desc>
